### C09 · `high` · shared-global-setting / same-day bracket collision

**Tasks:** `SLT-SW-08`, `SLT-SW-04`, `SLT-SW-02`, `SLT-ADM-01`, `SLT-MYA-04`, `SLT-DUN-05`

