 ## Issues filed
 
 - `issues/SLT-CHK-08-d06-watch-guarantees-missing-d04-cohort.md` — five closed D04 source tasks left unconditional D06 renewal/reminder/conversion guarantees with no numeric fixtures; this is a QA coverage finding, not a product-renewal failure.
