 ## Issues filed
 
 - `issues/SLT-CHK-08-d06-watch-guarantees-missing-d04-cohort.md` — five closed D04 source tasks left unconditional D06 renewal/reminder/conversion guarantees with no numeric fixtures; this is a QA coverage finding, not a product-renewal failure.
 - `issues/SLT-MYA-03-payment-method-change-treated-as-zero-dollar-renewal.md` — Paddle payment-method-change transaction created a completed `$0.00` renewal/order/mail, advanced the local date, and canceled the current-cycle actions while Paddle still reported that remote billing gate at finding time.
 - `issues/SLT-EML-02-manual-payment-updates-wrong-subscription.md` — paying manual renewal order `13063` for sub `11959` silently reverted unrelated same-user sub `12655` from its Mastercard source to Visa 4242; D06 order `13223` then charged that wrong source while Mastercard 4444 remained default.
+- `issues/SLT-SW-05-paddle-order-pay-no-valid-items.md` — Paddle worked for the initial Basic purchase but could not translate switch proration order `13354` into a valid hosted-checkout item, leaving the upgrade unpaid.
+- `issues/SLT-SW-05-preview-total-disagrees-with-order-pay.md` — the portal asked the customer to confirm `$10.00`, then created a `$9.90` order-pay charge before the separate Paddle failure.
+- `issues/SLT-SW-10-pending-cancellation-sets-cancelled-date-early.md` — active pending-cancellation sub `13402` received `_cancelled_date` at request time, nearly 24 hours before its queued status transition.
 
