+- `issues/SLT-SW-05-paddle-order-pay-no-valid-items.md` — Paddle worked for the initial Basic purchase but could not translate switch proration order `13354` into a valid hosted-checkout item, leaving the upgrade unpaid.
+- `issues/SLT-SW-05-preview-total-disagrees-with-order-pay.md` — the portal asked the customer to confirm `$10.00`, then created a `$9.90` order-pay charge before the separate Paddle failure.
